New: DataOutInterface::write_vtu_in_parallel() and
DataOutInterface::write_vtu_with_pvtu_record() now take an additional
parameter <code>use_mpi_io</code>. If set to false (the new default), all
participating ranks send their data in sequence to rank 0, which then
writes the file. This avoids severe performance problems on network file
systems that do not properly support MPI IO. Set the parameter to true to
use the previous MPI IO based implementation.
